flowchart LR
  Files[CSV / JSONL] --> Validate[Explicit mapping and atomic validation]
  Validate --> History[Separate history database]
  History --> Labels[Independent reviewed labels]
  Labels --> Snapshot[Immutable grouped dataset splits]
  Snapshot --> Context[Optional prior development context]
  Snapshot --> Runner[Offline experiment runner]
  Context --> Model[Context-aware model adapter]
  Model --> Runner
  Runner --> Gate[Shared deterministic policy gate]
  Gate --> Rules[Mandatory checks then review rules]
  Rules --> Report[Case differences and predeclared thresholds]
  Report --> Adopt[Explicit human configuration adoption]
  Gate -. safe telemetry .-> OTLP[Optional bounded OTLP export]
  Adopt --> Runtime[Runtime authorization and simulation]
